OL,3,AMPs vote against fresh move to legalise
OL,4,Aassisted dying in England and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FMPs have voted against a fresh move to
OL,7,Flegalise assisted dying in England and
OL,8,FWales
OL,10,FThe bill was defeated with 270 MPs
OL,11,Fvoting for and 286 voting against -
OL,12,Fwhat happens now?
OL,14,FIt was the second attempt to change the
OL,15,Flaw - last year an identical bill was
OL,16,Fsupported by MPs, but stalled and ran
OL,17,Fout of time in the House of Lords
OL,19,FThe bill would have allowed adults with
OL,20,Ffewer than six months to live to apply
OL,21,Fto be given help to end their own life,
OL,22,Fsubject to certain safeguards
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
