OL,3,AMPs vote against fresh move to legalise
OL,4,Aassisted dying in England and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoth sides had expected the result to
OL,7,Fbe close - one person closely involved
OL,8,Ftold the BBC: "It's on a knife edge"
